    "Specializations may target Attributes or Abilities with rating 4 or higher.",
    "The prototype stores specialization identity and label independently from Dice execution.",
    "Specialization is treated as optional at rating 4+ until the source requirement is reviewed.",
    "Only one active specialization per target is recommended for Slice 001, but this remains provisional.",
    "Suggested specialization labels come from package catalogs; user-authored labels are permitted as prototype data.",
